# Static Linux — KDE Plasma 6
# Tier: Recommended (4 GB). Wayland by default (X11 session still works).
# Heavier than the other environments at idle (~700-900 MB) — sl-detect never
# recommends it, it's there for people who want a full desktop.
# Verified against the official repos 2026-10-23.

